      "widgets_values": [
        "Macro shot of an exposed mechanical watch movement on matte dark slate: rhodium-plated bridges with fine parallel striping, polished bevels, deep red jewels, heat-blued screws, and a golden balance wheel with a fine hairspring at the exact center. The balance wheel swings vigorously through wide arcs from the first frame, the hairspring visibly breathing, while the escape wheel beside it advances in crisp, rapid ticks. The camera makes one bold, smooth move: a sweeping orbit to the right combined with a push-in, travelling from the full circular movement to a close view of the balance wheel, always centered. Bright specular highlights race across the striped bridges and bevels as angles change, and foreground bridge edges slide past the lens in parallax. Controlled upper-left key light, cool rim light, refined neutral color. No logos, numbers or markings, one continuous shot.",
        "manual",
        1280,
        720,
        121,
        1234,
